<title>POLAND: AMERBANK SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.75 vs    0.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.76 vs    0.31</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.46 vs    1.84</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 4.21 vs    3.84</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  5.88 vs    4.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   11.05 vs    6.46</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 28.62 vs   28.80</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	36.93 vs   32.36</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Amerykanski w</p>
<p>Polsce Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
